# AI Assistance Disclosure:
# Tool: Codex (model: GPT-6), date: 2026-09-28
# Scope: Added safe API Gateway and frontend configuration examples.
# Author review: Pending gateway owner review.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FoC — Friend on Campus · Environment configuration (EXAMPLE)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values:   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored — NEVER commit real secrets.
# Any variable read by any service MUST appear here with a safe
# placeholder so teammates know what to set.
#
# This is just an example; you can add more variables as needed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ---- Global -------------------------------------------------
LOG_LEVEL=

# ---- Auth / JWT -----------
JWT_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=

# ... Add more variables as needed

# ---- API Gateway --------------------------------------------
GATEWAY_PORT=3003
USER_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3001
SUPPLIER_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:3002
USER_SERVICE_JWKS_URL=http://localhost:3001/.well-known/jwks.json
GATEWAY_AUTH_PREFIX=/auth
GATEWAY_LOCATIONS_PREFIX=/locations
GATEWAY_JWT_ISSUER=
GATEWAY_JWT_AUDIENCE=

# ---- Frontend -----------------------------------------------
FRONTEND_GATEWAY_URL=http://localhost:3003
